{"3917680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NectorX", "steam_appid": 3917680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/643e6ccda9c7f6947c257e032d45e38e.avif?t=1756276018\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NectorX is an arcade rail shooter where you control a spaceship and fight against rogue machines that cross your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/d7c70dd28054a848d11be5c296849576.poster.avif?t=1756276018\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/d7c70dd28054a848d11be5c296849576.webm?t=1756276018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/d7c70dd28054a848d11be5c296849576.mp4?t=1756276018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/432874f0888c0cf3d864192fe96c659d.poster.avif?t=1756276018\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/432874f0888c0cf3d864192fe96c659d.webm?t=1756276018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/432874f0888c0cf3d864192fe96c659d.mp4?t=1756276018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/b9858974cf0d5679f654faeee3a7f191.poster.avif?t=1756276018\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/b9858974cf0d5679f654faeee3a7f191.webm?t=1756276018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/b9858974cf0d5679f654faeee3a7f191.mp4?t=1756276018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/b0df65118334f3f3ec2572a7801365e0.avif?t=1756276018\" width=1560 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter 10 challenging levels in which you will face different enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/d7324ab4a6e1dd0e4b726ec764bbf544.avif?t=1756276018\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonuses will multiply your score based on the number of levels you complete perfectly, the shooting mode, and the difficulty chosen. These bonuses will set you apart from the rest and demonstrate your skill, dexterity, and ability to take risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/23c76699fce8423538aefd9eedada501.poster.avif?t=1756276018\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917680/extras/23c7